@ Your dad, HISHAM (replaces Norman as the Petalburg GYM LEADER). He talks about his company SEQUOIA,
@ loves HAMZA like a son (even though LAYTH is his real son), hangs out with PROF. MO, likes IZZO,
@ and plays pool. Wally is written out: his house in Petalburg is IZZO's.

@@ file: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc
PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadYoureHereWithYourPokemon:
	.string "DAD: Hm?\p"
	.string "Well, if it isn't {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "All moved in?\p"
	.string "I just got off a call with SEQUOIA.\n"
	.string "Big deal. Very big deal.\p"
	.string "Oh! You've got a POKéMON!\n"
	.string "PROF. MO gave it to you?\p"
	.string "MO and I are playing pool tonight.\n"
	.string "I always win. Don't tell him.\p"
	.string "Did you meet HAMZA next door?\n"
	.string "Great kid. Like a son to me.\p"
	.string "…You're great too, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "And LAYTH. Where is LAYTH?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoCollectBadges:
	.string "DAD: Now, {PLAYER}, if you want to be\n"
	.string "a strong TRAINER, here's my advice.\p"
	.string "Head for RUSTBORO CITY beyond this\n"
	.string "town, and challenge ROXANNE.\p"
	.string "Then beat the other GYM LEADERS\n"
	.string "and collect their BADGES.\p"
	.string "Think of it as an investment.\n"
	.string "That's how we do it at SEQUOIA.\p"
	.string "I'm a GYM LEADER, too. We'll battle\n"
	.string "one day, when you're stronger.\p"
	.string "And no gimmicks! HAMZA says they're\n"
	.string "great. HAMZA is wrong. I love him.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToRustboro:
	.string "DAD: Hm? Aren't you going to the\n"
	.string "GYM in RUSTBORO CITY?\p"
	.string "Come back with four GYM BADGES,\n"
	.string "and then we'll battle.\p"
	.string "Until then, I'll be at the pool\n"
	.string "table with MO and IZZO.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToDewford:
	.string "DAD: So, you beat ROXANNE!\n"
	.string "That's my kid!\p"
	.string "HAMZA beat him first, but still!\p"
	.string "Across the sea in DEWFORD TOWN is\n"
	.string "a GYM LEADER named BRAWLY.\p"
	.string "You should go challenge him.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_YouHaveGottenStronger:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}, you've gotten\n"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "Your BADGES are like a portfolio.\n"
	.string "It's growing nicely.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanIntro:
	.string "DAD: Hm…\n"
	.string "So, you got four GYM BADGES.\p"
	.string "As I promised, we'll battle.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}…\p"
	.string "I'm so happy I get to battle my own\n"
	.string "kid. HAMZA was here last week, too.\p"
	.string "But a battle is a battle! I'll play\n"
	.string "it like a game of pool.\p"
	.string "Every shot called. Give it your\n"
	.string "best shot, too!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanDefeat:
	.string "…\p"
	.string "I… I can't…\p"
	.string "I lost to {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "I scratched on the eight ball…\p"
	.string "But rules are rules!\n"
	.string "Here, take this.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHappyAndSad:
	.string "DAD: As a GYM LEADER, I'm upset…\p"
	.string "But as a father, I'm proud.\n"
	.string "I'm telling everyone at SEQUOIA.\p"
	.string "And HAMZA. And IZZO. And MO.\n"
	.string "I'll text LAYTH, too.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_PleaseComeWithMe:
	.string "IZZO: Ah, there you are, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "HISHAM's kid! Please come with me.\n"
	.string "I have something for you.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LetMeBorrowPlayer:
	.string "IZZO: HISHAM, you don't mind,\n"
	.string "do you?\p"
	.string "Let me borrow {PLAYER} for\n"
	.string "a minute or two.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoingToKeepTraining:
	.string "DAD: Go visit your mother every\n"
	.string "so often, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "I'm going to stay here and train.\n"
	.string "And practice my bank shots.\p"
	.string "I have to avenge my loss to you!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadNoAmountOfTrainingIsEnough:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}, how are things?\p"
	.string "I called HAMZA today.\n"
	.string "He didn't pick up.\p"
	.string "The world of POKéMON is deep.\n"
	.string "Like SEQUOIA's pockets.$"

@@ file: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc
PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_ThanksForPlayingWithWally:
	.string "IZZO: You're…\n"
	.string "Ah, HISHAM's kid, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "Your dad's my best friend. Well, he\n"
	.string "says MO is. We play pool.\p"
	.string "He talks about SEQUOIA the whole\n"
	.string "game. And about HAMZA.\p"
	.string "Never about LAYTH. Funny, that.$"

PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WonderHowWallyIsDoing:
	.string "IZZO: I wonder if HISHAM will\n"
	.string "ever let me win at pool.$"

PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_PleaseExcuseUs:
	.string "IZZO: {PLAYER}! Sorry for dragging\n"
	.string "you over here.\p"
	.string "You beat HISHAM! He called me right\n"
	.string "away. He was so proud.\p"
	.string "Well, first he called HAMZA.\n"
	.string "Then MO. Then me.\p"
	.string "Anyway, this isn't a bribe or\n"
	.string "anything, but you should have this.$"

PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WallyIsComingHomeSoon:
	.string "IZZO: HISHAM and MO are coming\n"
	.string "over for pool tonight.\p"
	.string "I'd invite you, but your dad would\n"
	.string "just talk about SEQUOIA.$"

PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_YouMetWallyInEverGrandeCity:
	.string "IZZO: Your dad still owes me\n"
	.string "a rematch at pool.$"

PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WallyWasReallyHappy:
	.string "My husband IZZO is always out\n"
	.string "playing pool with your dad.\p"
	.string "HISHAM always wins. I think\n"
	.string "he practices in secret.$"

PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WallyLeftWithoutTelling:
	.string "Keep this a secret from IZZO…\p"
	.string "HISHAM lets him win at pool\n"
	.string "sometimes. Out of kindness.$"

@ Wally's role is YASEEN's. His relatives still live in Verdanturf, without the frail-and-sickly bits.
@@ file: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc
VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WallysNextDoor:
	.string "UNCLE: Oh! {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "YASEEN's next door.\p"
	.string "Ever since he caught HEESHUPEESHU,\n"
	.string "that boy hasn't stopped training.\p"
	.string "I think POKéMON are giving him\n"
	.string "a real dream.$"

VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_MeetWanda:
	.string "WANDA: You are?\n"
	.string "Oh, right, I get it!\p"
	.string "You're the {PLAYER} who YASEEN was\n"
	.string "telling me about.\p"
	.string "I'm YASEEN's cousin.\n"
	.string "Glad to meet you!\p"
	.string "He talks about you and his\n"
	.string "HEESHUPEESHU all day long.$"

@ The Petalburg house that was Wally's is IZZO's (Dad's friend, who gives you HM SURF).
@@ file: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc
PetalburgCity_Text_WallyHouseSign:
	.string "IZZO'S HOUSE$"
